  "validation": [
    "Inherited real login/MFA/CSRF cases run in legacy and modular security configurations",
    "Actual native OAuth and OIDC discovery responses match declared routes; other business/MCP/health paths are not captured",
    "Historical authorization event identity, H2 outbox outage/restart/duplicate/rollback tests, audit-only shared ledger plan",
    "MFA key migration belongs to identity; OAuth adapter persistence boundary remains strict",
    "35-module capability/persistence/repository ownership gates; frontend-enabled authorization distribution and scoped zero-warning Checkstyle"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Legacy Authorization deliberately excludes the credential RPC provider; Common remains its legacy provider",
    "Composable authorization currently requires local identity and OIDC domain services; no claim of a remote stateless authorization adapter",
    "Browser session-to-business authorization adapter and formal standalone host/deployment still pending",
    "Running environment unchanged"
  ]
